          "provider": "gemini",
          "rank": 1,
          "reason": "Vericel delivered a massive beat-and-raise quarter on November 5, with EPS of $0.27 versus the $0.06 consensus and a 26% revenue jump. Management raised full-year guidance for the third consecutive time. This idiosyncratic fundamental strength allowed the stock to rally roughly 12% even as the broader market collapsed, demonstrating significant relative strength.",
