          "provider": "qwen",
          "rank": 1,
          "reason": "Massive Q3 beat (EPS $0.27 vs $0.06 est, revenue $85.4M +26% YoY) with raised FY guidance to $344-346M. Stock surged 14% despite market crash showing exceptional relative strength. Analyst targets $57-61 suggest further upside from current ~$52 levels.",
